	COMMENT [bootstrap] named by its own Lombok @Slf4j logger literal "com.charlesproxy.model.TransactionBody"
	COMMENT Holds one request or response body, buffering it in memory up to 100 KiB and spilling to a temp file beyond that. A Cleaner deletes the temp file when the body is collected, and the decoded bytes are cached behind a SoftReference.
